{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25811","headline":"渡西陵十六韵 · 李绅","name":"渡西陵十六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨送奔涛远，风收骇浪平。\n截流张斾影，分岸走鼙声。\n兽逐衔波涌，龟艨喷棹轻。\n海门凝雾暗，江渚湿云横。\n雁翼看舟子，鱼鳞辨水营。\n骑交遮戍合，戈簇拥沙明。\n谬履千夫长，将询百吏情。\n下车占黍稷，冬雨害粢盛。\n望祷依前圣，垂休翼厚生。\n半江犹惨澹，全野已澄清。\n爱景三辰朗，祥农万庾盈。\n浦程通曲屿，海色媚重城。\n弓日鞬櫜动，旗风虎豹争。\n及郊挥白羽，入里卷红旌。\n恺悌思陈力，端庄冀表诚。\n临人与安俗，非止奉师贞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25811.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25811","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}